      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "the_run_scope_comes_from_the_execution_database",
          "description": "Year 2020, August, hour 7, road type 4, county 26161, zone 261610 -- byte for byte `process-crankcase-running`'s scope, and its THC block of MOVESOutput is byte-identical to this one's, so the whole activity half and the whole criteria-pollutant parent are already checked end to end by that fixture. The RunSpec XML says month 7 and hour 6; the execution database says 8 and 7, and it is the authority (docs/process-airtoxics.md 0.1). Three run-level numbers are pinned besides: `GPAFract` is 0, so both fuel-effect blends select their normal arm; the temperature is 59.5 degF and reaches both arms of the temperature branch; and the A/C activity quadratic is negative and clamps to 0. (The E10 fuel subtype, 12, that the altTHC path's two lookups key on no longer has a run-level variable and is not asserted.) `specificHumidity` and `molWaterFraction` are NOT read by this fixture and have no variable: pollutant 1 never enters the NOx humidity arm.",
