        {
          "id": "the_collapsed_base_rate_reproduces_baseRateByAge_and_reaches_every_species_row",
          "description": "S13 and S14 against `baseRateByAge_1_2020`, the reference's own generator output, at both day types and all four fuel types. `emissionratebyage` carries polProcessID 101 alone, so only the 124 THC rate rows take their rate from it; the self-join that carried that rate to the twenty pollutant-processes chained off it, `rtDay_rootRate`, is gone from the model and is not asserted; the chained rows' own base rate is asserted to be exactly 0 (NMHC row 2829). Its temperature factor is 1, so the root rate and the reference base rate are equal to the reference's own six significant figures. Electricity is rated at exactly zero and the row exists.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "tolerance": {
            "rel": 2e-05
          },
