        {
          "id": "the_temperature_stage_takes_both_arms_and_the_air_conditioning_arm_is_dead",
          "description": "S15's temperature arm, adjust.rs:87-142, with TWO of its four branches live in one document. Electricity Total Energy on running exhaust takes the EV quadratic about 72 degF; every other rate row takes the fall-through quadratic about 75 degF. The PM branch needs pollutant 118 or 112 and the NOx branch pollutant 3, and neither is selected -- `noxhumidityadjust` is populated in this snapshot and is read by nothing, which is why this fixture has no humidity variables at all. `temperatureadjustment` has exactly ONE row, polProcessID 9101 / fuelTypeID 9 / regClassID 0, so the wildcard arm of `exact_else_wildcard` is the only one that ever fires and every rate row outside the EV branch has A and B at the additive identity and a factor of exactly 1. The EV row's raw adjustment is +0.015625 at 59.5 degF, above the max(., 0) clamp, and the heat-index suppression is reachable (source type 21 is light duty) and does not fire at 7.5 degF of margin. The A/C arm is live in its table and dead in its result: `fullacadjustment` carries real polProcessID 101 and 9101 rows and `rtDay_meanBaseRateACAdj` is a real number, but the activity quadratic clamps to 0 at this heat index so none of it reaches an emitted cell.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_hasTempAdjustExact",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_hasTempAdjustExact",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 41
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_tempAdjustTermA",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_tempAdjustTermB",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_tempAdjustTermA",
              "time": 0.0,
